triage: fix_tests: In every failing scenario the move log shows both Responders answering 'Accept', not 'Reject'. The game then correctly paid the Proposer pot - a - b, which gives 70+90+110+130 = 400 each over a full game, 130 in round 1 and +70 in the round-12 case. The game follows the rules; the tests assumed rejections they never actually scripted, since the 'decline' default resolved to Accept.
