triage: revise_rules: The game file is correct; the design is degenerate. A single Accept passes the deal and rejecting never costs a Responder anything, so offering 0/0 keeps nearly the whole pot and accepting is never worse than rejecting, which is why the 'first option' policy wins every decided match and the 'last option' policy loses every one.
